Looking at this problem, I need to find the minimum number of racks (capacity 199 kW each) to guarantee packing 1990 units (1 kW each), where each project cluster has ≤ 39 units and must stay in one rack. This is a bin-packing problem: pack items of size ≤ 39 into bins of capacity 199, total 1990, for the worst-case cluster distribution.

